      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Being able to specify a \"fallback material\" would be sweet. The fallback material would have to use one of the internal shaders like Standard or the internal Toon shader. That way we can still tweak how something looks, without having to rely on ugly hacks like naming the shader \"Unlit Cutout\".",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
