      "value": "@{5a69eccdd20e79665351e7c1|full_name}: that's not how the fallback system works. The \"fallback\" there has an entirely different meaning. \"Fallback\" in shader is useful for getting generic shadow casters from other shaders, or for falling back if the current hardware doesn't support a feature. It isn't related to VRChat's shader fallback system.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
